  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>scalar-field-ridges-ridges · 1×1×1 workgroups × 64×1×1 lanes = 64 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-raster-scalar-field-ridges-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-raster-scalar-field-ridges-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"2\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAMAAAAOwC77AAAABlBMVEVfZnLZ2dmiVvOOAAAATUlEQVR4AQFCAL3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBALoAELpmZmIAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>64 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const valuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; values: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const inputValidityOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; inputValidity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const ridgesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; ridges: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const validityOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; validity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const strengthOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; strength: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">fn isFiniteValue(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">struct SmallestSymmetricEigen2 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  value: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  vector: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">fn getSmallestSymmetricEigen2(first: f32, cross: f32, second: f32) -&gt; SmallestSymmetricEigen2 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  if (cross == 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">    return SmallestSymmetricEigen2(min(first, second),\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">      select(vec2&lt;f32&gt;(1.0, 0.0), vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0, 1.0), second &lt; first));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  let exponent = frexp(max(abs(first), max(abs(cross), abs(second)))).exp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  let scaledFirst = ldexp(first, -exponent);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  let scaledSecond = ldexp(second, -exponent);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  let scaledCross = abs(ldexp(cross, -exponent));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  let halfGap = 0.5 * abs(scaledFirst - scaledSecond);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  var tangent = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  if (halfGap &gt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">    // Either the gap or coupling is large enough to square safely. If the gap is zero,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">    // the tangent is exactly one, including when scaledCross underflows.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">    let radius = length(vec2&lt;f32&gt;(halfGap, scaledCross));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">    tangent = scaledCross / (halfGap + radius);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  let correction = abs(cross) * tangent;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  let crossSign = select(-1.0, 1.0, cross &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  let direction = select(vec2&lt;f32&gt;(1.0, -crossSign * tangent),\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    vec2&lt;f32&gt;(tangent, -crossSign), second &lt; first);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  return SmallestSymmetricEigen2(min(first, second) - correction,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">    direction / sqrt(1.0 + tangent * tangent));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">fn getScaledQuotient(value: f32, first: f32, second: f32, power: i32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  if (value == 0.0) { return value; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  let numerator = frexp(value);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  let firstDivisor = frexp(first);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  let secondDivisor = frexp(second);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  let quotient = frexp(numerator.fract / (firstDivisor.fract * secondDivisor.fract));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  return ldexp(quotient.fract,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">    numerator.exp - firstDivisor.exp - secondDivisor.exp + power + quotient.exp);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">const WIDTH: u32 = 7u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">const HEIGHT: u32 = 7u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">fn getGroundCellSize(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  let cellSize = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(parameters[parametersOffset + 0u], parameters[parametersOffset + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  return cellSize;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">fn readValue(column: u32, row: u32) -&gt; f32 { return values[valuesOffset + row * WIDTH + column]; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"70\">@compute @workgroup_size(64)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"71\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  _ = &amp;values;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  _ = &amp;inputValidity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  _ = &amp;ridges;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  _ = &amp;validity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  _ = &amp;strength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 67108864u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 64u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  let column = index % WIDTH;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  let row = index / WIDTH;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  ridges[ridgesOffset + index] = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  validity[validityOffset + index] = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">  strength[strengthOffset + index] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">  if (column == 0u || row == 0u || column + 1u == WIDTH || row + 1u == HEIGHT) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  for (var rowOffset = -1; rowOffset &lt;= 1; rowOffset++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">    for (var columnOffset = -1; columnOffset &lt;= 1; columnOffset++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">      let neighbor = u32(i32(row) + rowOffset) * WIDTH + u32(i32(column) + columnOffset);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">      if (inputValidity[inputValidityOffset + neighbor] == 0u || !isFiniteValue(values[valuesOffset + neighbor])) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  let spacing = getGroundCellSize(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  if (!all(spacing &gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0)) || !isFiniteValue(spacing.x) || !isFiniteValue(spacing.y)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">  let center = readValue(column, row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">  let west = readValue(column - 1u, row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">  let east = readValue(column + 1u, row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  let previousRow = readValue(column, row - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  let nextRow = readValue(column, row + 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  let gradient = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(getScaledQuotient(east - west, spacing.x, 1.0, -1),\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">    getScaledQuotient(nextRow - previousRow, spacing.y, 1.0, -1));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  let columnCurvature = getScaledQuotient((east - center) + (west - center), spacing.x, spacing.x, 0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  let rowCurvature = getScaledQuotient((nextRow - center) + (previousRow - center), spacing.y, spacing.y, 0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  let crossCurvature = getScaledQuotient((readValue(column + 1u, row + 1u) - readValue(column - 1u, row + 1u)) -\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">    (readValue(column + 1u, row - 1u) - readValue(column - 1u, row - 1u)), spacing.x, spacing.y, -2);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  if (!isFiniteValue(columnCurvature) || !isFiniteValue(rowCurvature) ||\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">      !isFiniteValue(crossCurvature) || !isFiniteValue(gradient.x) || !isFiniteValue(gradient.y)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  // Keep the smaller diagonal in its original units: a common Hessian scale can underflow\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  // it even when the final eigenvalue is normal. Only the bounded eigenvector tangent is scaled.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  let eigensystem = getSmallestSymmetricEigen2(columnCurvature, crossCurvature, rowCurvature);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  let smallest = eigensystem.value;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  if (!isFiniteValue(smallest)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  validity[validityOffset + index] = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  strength[strengthOffset + index] = max(0.0, -smallest);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  if (!(smallest &lt; 0.0) || -smallest &lt; parameters[parametersOffset + 5u] || center &lt; parameters[parametersOffset + 4u]) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">  var normal = eigensystem.vector;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  if (normal.x &lt; 0.0 || (normal.x == 0.0 &amp;&amp; normal.y &lt; 0.0)) { normal = -normal; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  let displacement = -dot(gradient, normal) / smallest;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  let pixelOffset = displacement * normal / spacing;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">  if (all(pixelOffset &gt;= vec2&lt;f32&gt;(-0.5)) &amp;&amp; all(pixelOffset &lt; vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.5))) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">    ridges[ridgesOffset + index] = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>values<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"scalarFieldValues\">scalarFieldValues</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>inputValidity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"scalarFieldValidity\">scalarFieldValidity</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"scalar-field-ridges-parameters\">scalar-field-ridges-parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>ridges<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"ridgeMask\">ridgeMask</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>validity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"ridgeValidity\">ridgeValidity</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>strength<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"ridgeStrength\">ridgeStrength</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUScalarFieldRidges · main · 560dede8</figcaption></figure></section>",
